1
00:00:00,670 --> 00:00:03,670
(Leonard:)Or the police. Or Homeland Security.

2
00:00:04,424 --> 00:00:05,504
So you're the reason...

3
00:00:05,675 --> 00:00:08,595
(Penny:)...I have to walk up and down
three flights of stairs every day?

4
00:00:08,762 --> 00:00:11,602
(Leonard:)So I did something stupid.
I'm sure you did stupid things.

5
00:00:11,765 --> 00:00:13,475
(Leonard:)What were you doing seven years ago?

6
00:00:13,642 --> 00:00:17,022
(Penny:)Excuse me, I was in high school.
Studying, keeping my nose clean...

7
00:00:17,187 --> 00:00:19,107
(Penny:)...doing volunteer work
for the community.

8
00:00:22,275 --> 00:00:26,025
(Past Penny:)Not pregnant. Yes!

9
00:00:27,364 --> 00:00:28,574
Ha, ha!

10
00:00:32,702 --> 00:00:38,002
Oh, Ubuntu, you are my favorite
Linux-based operating system.

11
00:00:38,166 --> 00:00:41,296
(Past Leonard:)-Hey.
-Hello.

12
00:00:42,587 --> 00:00:44,337
(Sheldon:)Why do I smell methacrylate?

13
00:00:44,506 --> 00:00:47,386
Oh, clear nail polish. I had a mani-pedi.

14
00:00:49,010 --> 00:00:50,340
(Leonard:)Men can get those.

15
00:00:51,555 --> 00:00:53,385
(Leonard:)Anyway, I may owe you an apology.

16
00:00:54,474 --> 00:00:56,434
(Sheldon:)There's doubt?

17
00:00:56,893 --> 00:01:00,523
(Leonard:)I did agree to the thermostat setting
and I shouldn't have tried to change it.

18
00:01:01,106 --> 00:01:02,646
(Sheldon:)That's not an apology.

19
00:01:02,816 --> 00:01:05,526
That's simply an acknowledgment
that I was right.

20
00:01:05,694 --> 00:01:08,284
(Leonard:)-Okay, I'm sorry.
-There you go.

21
00:01:08,989 --> 00:01:10,029
(Leonard:)So we're good?

22
00:01:11,241 --> 00:01:14,411
(Sheldon:)-Good what?
-Never mind.

23
00:01:15,078 --> 00:01:18,288
(Leonard:)-Okay if I watch some TV?
-Go ahead.

24
00:01:18,707 --> 00:01:21,707
MAN [ON TV]:
Up next: Babylon 5.

25
00:01:22,919 --> 00:01:25,299
LEONARD: You're not even watching.
SHELDON: I can hear it.

26
00:01:25,463 --> 00:01:27,383
LEONARD:
Oh, so the dialogue offends you?

27
00:01:27,549 --> 00:01:29,589
SHELDON:
I would hardly call that dialogue.

28
00:01:29,759 --> 00:01:31,339
LEONARD:
You are insane, you know that?

29
00:01:31,511 --> 00:01:35,391
SHELDON: Don't make me turn that flag
upside down because you know I'll do it.

